# The context .github/workflows/browser-image.yaml builds browser.Dockerfile from is .github, for
# one file outside this directory: .github/scripts/network-install.sh, which the install RUN
# bind-mounts to bound its reads of the network. This file, which BuildKit reads beside that
# Dockerfile, cuts the context to this directory and that one script, so the build receives what
# it received when its context was .github/docker, and the script.
*
!docker
!scripts/network-install.sh
